            "text": "Classic beauty and contemporary amenities - this property has it all. Versatility meets exceptional updates at 610 Jiron Street. Featuring an updated classic Santa Fe main residence as well as an attached studio, this move-in-ready property offers excellent flexibility-an elegant home with additional rental income, a private guest suite, or dedicated work-from-home space. The studio has its own private entrance, covered patio, outdoor space, and loft with mountain views. Behind latilla and stucco walls, the light-filled main residence blends classic Santa Fe character with extensive modern improvements. Venetian plaster walls, coved viga ceilings, nichos, and a striking kiva-style fireplace highlight warmth and architectural appeal. Thoughtful renovations include a completely new kitchen, new windows, new Venetian plaster, added primary bathroom, remodeled second bathroom, new radiant heating, new plumbing, new windows, new flooring, new on-demand water heater, new lighting, new exterior doors, and new fencing. The single-level main residence offers two bedrooms, two bathrooms, and a flexible skylit bonus room currently used as the dining room. Removable cabinetry in the office adds style and functionality while allowing the space to easily serve other uses, including a second bedroom. The covered front portal provides an inviting outdoor seating area. The attached two-level studio offers its own kitchen, remodeled bathroom with a custom plaster shower, living area, loft, separate entrance, and private outdoor spaces, making it ideal for guests, extended family, rental opportunities, or a retreat. A large double gate provides secure off-street parking within the fenced property. Conveniently located near South St. Francis Drive, Agua Fria Street, downtown Santa Fe, restaurants, galleries, museums, parks, shopping, and employment centers, this updated property combines flexibility, quality improvements, and move-in readiness in one superb offering.",
